diff --git a/replit.md b/replit.md
index e5d801c6a..827ef728a 100644
--- a/replit.md
+++ b/replit.md
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@ OpenClaw Cloud employs a "CEO Proxy + Gateway" architecture, where two component
 -   **Process Manager & Bot Registry**: A web UI for managing ad-hoc and registered bots, including start/stop controls and auto-restart capabilities for bots residing in `skills/bots/`.
 -   **Watched Instruments & Trading Panel**: The IG Dashboard features a tab-based instrument watchlist with live prices, market status indicators, and an instrument search modal. Users can search IG markets, add/remove instruments from the watchlist, and trade directly. The Deal panel supports BUY/SELL with size, stop distance, limit distance, and force open/net off options. The Order tab supports limit/stop orders with price level. The Info tab shows instrument details (min size, contract size, slippage, margin). API endpoints: `GET /api/ig/watchedlist`, `POST /api/ig/watchedlist` (add), `DELETE /api/ig/watchedlist/:i` (remove). Watchlist is stored in `ig-monitor-config.json` instruments array.
 -   **Interactive Price Charts**: The dashboard chart shows IG price history for the selected instrument with selectable timeframes (1M, 5M, 15M, 1H, 4H, 1D, 1W). Charts support scroll-to-zoom, drag-to-pan, and double-click reset via chartjs-plugin-zoom. Data fetched from `GET /api/ig/pricehistory/{epic}?resolution=...&max=...`.
--   **Strategy Management Dashboard**: The IG Dashboard (`ig-dashboard.html`) provides full CRUD controls for bot trading strategies via live API (`/api/ig/strategies`). Features: toggle individual strategies on/off, inline edit (entry level, stop/limit distances, size, name), delete strategies, master bot enable/disable switch, and bot process start/stop buttons. Open positions can be edited (stop/limit levels) and closed directly from the dashboard. API endpoints: `GET /api/ig/strategies`, `PUT /api/ig/strategies/:i`, `DELETE /api/ig/strategies/:i`, `POST /api/ig/strategies/:i/toggle`, `POST /api/ig/strategies/global`.
+-   **Strategy Management Dashboard**: The IG Dashboard (`ig-dashboard.html`) provides full CRUD controls for bot trading strategies via live API (`/api/ig/strategies`). Features: toggle individual strategies on/off, inline edit (entry level, stop/limit distances, size, name), delete strategies, master bot enable/disable switch, bot process start/stop buttons, and "Add Strategy" button (JSON modal). Strategies can be attached to open positions via `dealId` and paused/resumed independently. Open positions show a Strategy dropdown for linking. Open positions can be edited (stop/limit levels) and closed directly from the dashboard. API endpoints: `GET /api/ig/strategies`, `POST /api/ig/strategies` (create), `PUT /api/ig/strategies/:i`, `DELETE /api/ig/strategies/:i`, `POST /api/ig/strategies/:i/toggle`, `POST /api/ig/strategies/:i/attach`, `POST /api/ig/strategies/:i/detach`, `POST /api/ig/strategies/:i/pause`, `POST /api/ig/strategies/global`. Dashboard uses modular JS files: `ig-strategy-manager.js` (strategy attach/detach/pause/add logic), `ig-live-prices.js` (live price updates). Backup stored in `ig-dashboard-backup/`.
 -   **Trade Proof Reader Config**: Editable proof reader thresholds via dashboard and API (`GET /api/ig/proofread`, `PUT /api/ig/proofread`). Controls: max price staleness, spread limits (high/low with mid threshold), min risk:reward ratio, max risk % of balance, max entry deviation %, allow duplicate positions, require stop-loss, require take-profit. Config stored in `.openclaw/ig-proofread-config.json`.
 -   **IG API Proxy**: Full-featured proxy for IG Group Trading API covering ALL IG operations: positions (open/close/update), working orders (create/update/delete), market search, price history, watchlists, activity/transaction history, and session management. Handles authentication automatically with centralized session management (4-minute proactive token refresh). All bots and agents route through this single proxy session — bots via `http://localhost:5000/api/ig/...`, agents via `https://$REPLIT_DEV_DOMAIN/api/ig/...` (agents MUST use the public URL because `web_fetch` blocks localhost due to SSRF protection). Market data responses are cached for 30 seconds to prevent IG rate limit errors. See `skills/ig-trading/IG-COMMANDS.md` for complete endpoint reference. Includes a multi-layered trade proof reader for risk mitigation.
 -   **Independent Live Streaming**: Lightstreamer price streaming can connect independently to the live IG account for fast price data, completely decoupled from the active trading profile. Config page has Connect/Disconnect button with green status indicator. Endpoints: `POST /api/ig/stream/connect-live`, `POST /api/ig/stream/disconnect-live`, `GET /api/ig/stream/status` (includes `liveStreamingActive` and `streamingSource` fields). Live streaming session has its own token refresh cycle.
